# MANIFEST — file ownership for rnd-project-memory
#
# Draft, 2026-08-17. Derived by reading all 32 files of templates/rnd-project, then revised
# after EXP-2026-08-17-pattern-list-extraction and EXP-2026-08-17-misdirection-recheck.
# See ownership-findings.md for the audit and the experiment records for the corrections.
#
# Format: <layer> <path>
#
#   mechanism  upstream owns it; replaced wholesale on upgrade
#   profile    stack-specific; substituted (but see the note on pre-commit below)
#   scaffold   copied at bootstrap only; upstream revisions never propagate
#   content    project-generated; upstream never reads or writes it
#   norcopy    belongs to the template repository; never copied into a project
#
# .template-hashes ships with a release and carries the sha256 of every mechanism entry below,
# with paths relative to a consumer's repository root. It is deliberately absent from this list:
# a file cannot carry its own hash. MIGRATIONS.md "Cutting a release" regenerates it.
#
# There is no region scope. An earlier draft fenced upstream preambles inside nine files and
# scoped manifest entries to those regions; that was withdrawn — markers serve a tool, and this
# design builds no tool. Rule changes reach projects through ai-sandbox/RULES.md, which is
# mechanism and replaced whole; preamble revisions ride on prose migrations.

# ─── never copied into an adopting project ───────────────────────────────────
norcopy    README.md
norcopy    ../RND_PROJECT_MEMORY.md

# ─── mechanism: replaced wholesale on upgrade ────────────────────────────────
mechanism  check.sh
mechanism  gitignore.template
mechanism  ai-sandbox/RULES.md
mechanism  ai-sandbox/RATIONALE.md
mechanism  ai-sandbox/playbooks/session-start.md
mechanism  ai-sandbox/playbooks/checkpoint.md
mechanism  ai-sandbox/playbooks/promote.md
mechanism  ai-sandbox/playbooks/ingest-source.md
mechanism  ai-sandbox/playbooks/run-experiment.md
mechanism  ai-sandbox/playbooks/upgrade-template.md
mechanism  ai-sandbox/sessions/_TEMPLATE.md
mechanism  ai-sandbox/experiments/_TEMPLATE.md
mechanism  ai-sandbox/playbooks/local/_TEMPLATE.md
mechanism  docs/decisions/_TEMPLATE.md
mechanism  docs/techniques/_TEMPLATE.md

# mechanism, with one exception to the profile's substitution semantics:
# a profile APPENDS credential patterns here, it never replaces the list. An absent or
# unsubstituted pattern source leaves an empty regex, which matches every line, blocks every
# commit on clean content, and trains the user into --no-verify. The inline core cannot go
# missing, and this is the one check whose failure a later edit cannot repair.
mechanism  .githooks/pre-commit

# ─── profile: substituted per stack ──────────────────────────────────────────
profile    ai-sandbox/DATA_ENVIRONMENT.md

# ─── scaffold: seeded once, the project's own thereafter ─────────────────────
# The register and index files below carry an upstream preamble above project entries. They
# are scaffold rather than mechanism because a stale preamble does not misdirect: the failure
# mode is missing a newly added rule, not following a false one, and rules that must reach
# existing projects live in RULES.md. See EXP-2026-08-17-misdirection-recheck.
scaffold   AGENTS.md
scaffold   ai-sandbox/INDEX.md
scaffold   ai-sandbox/CHECKPOINT-thread.md
scaffold   ai-sandbox/OPEN_QUESTIONS.md
scaffold   ai-sandbox/ASSUMPTIONS.md
scaffold   ai-sandbox/SOURCES.md
scaffold   ai-sandbox/CAVEATS.yaml
scaffold   ai-sandbox/PUBLICATIONS.md
scaffold   ai-sandbox/CONFIGURATIONS.md
scaffold   ai-sandbox/sessions/LOG.md
scaffold   ai-sandbox/experiments/LOG.md
scaffold   docs/CLAIMS.md

# Temporary by design — exists only until the 3-week staleness threshold is validated against
# real data, then deleted along with the answer. See its own header and RATIONALE.md.
scaffold   ai-sandbox/STALENESS_LOG.md

# starting shapes for documents the project writes
scaffold   ai-sandbox/ASSISTANT_PROFILE.md
scaffold   docs/problem.md
scaffold   docs/method.md
scaffold   docs/constraints.md
scaffold   docs/glossary.md
scaffold   src/README.md
scaffold   sources/README.md
scaffold   ai-sandbox/results/README.md

# ─── content: project-generated, upstream never touches ──────────────────────
content    ai-sandbox/sessions/*.md
content    ai-sandbox/experiments/EXP-*.md
content    ai-sandbox/CHECKPOINT-*.md
content    ai-sandbox/env/*.md
content    ai-sandbox/results/*.json
content    ai-sandbox/playbooks/local/*.md
content    docs/decisions/ADR-*.md
content    docs/techniques/*.md
content    sources/**
content    src/**
